SWITCHPILER patch 0009: the in-game keyboard (software keyboard applet) opens a native text box.

suyu-cmd has no keyboard UI and its stub answered every keyboard request with the word "suyu"
(issue #6). Now the player types the text in a dialog: zenity or kdialog on Linux, a PowerShell
InputBox on Windows. Initial text, length limit and cancel are respected.

--- a/src/core/frontend/applets/software_keyboard.cpp
+++ b/src/core/frontend/applets/software_keyboard.cpp
@@ -4,6 +4,10 @@
